<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila bourse stops AGP B price rise.</title>
<headline>Manila bourse stops AGP B price rise.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange (PSE) on Friday froze the share price of AGP Industrial Corp B when it rose 14 pesos, or 50 percent, to 42 pesos.</p>
<p>The PSE compliance department said the company has been asked to explain the surge in its share price.</p>
<p>The stock exchange automatically freezes the price of a share when it shoots up by about 50 percent or when it falls by about 40 percent in a single session.</p>
